ve gas or a fake stick of gum  that's actually plastic explosives  another thing that dr bright is not  allowed to do with the foundation no  using scps to affect the outcome on  american idol or any other reality show  competition previous violations of this  rule have included showing his least  favorite american idol contestant  scp-096 his face in the hope that it  would hunt him down sneaking scp-348 to  a hell's kitchen contestant and  releasing scp-049 into the house on the  bachelorette because quote none of them  are good enough for rachel so they all  deserve to die dr bryant is to be  reminded that if he cannot stay on his  best behavior and stay out of the  competition his tv privileges will be  revoked and does he really want to risk  missing the latest season of love is  blind i didn't think so  another thing that dr bright is not  allowed to do at the foundation dr  bright is not allowed to edit the list  of things he is not allowed to do due to  some unsubstantiated rumors perpetuated  by dr bright himself we must issue a  formal correction if an scp file says  never to do something that is not  because we are trying to control your  mind for example warnings not to look at  scp-096's face are for your own  protection if you would like to look at  its face and bring about your own  untimely end then that is up to you but  don't say we didn't warn you no they're  trying to control you don't listen to  them  no we are not dr bright i see you you  can't type into this script anymore your  ip address has already been blocked in  conclusion if he would let us get our  work done for once in his miserable  endless life dr bright is not allowed to  attempt any manipulation mind control or  subterfuge of any kind via official scp  foundation documents  another thing that dr bright is not  allowed to do at the foundation telling  new researchers that you can tame  scp-682 with a rolled-up newspaper and a  tummy rub when you've been alive for as  long as dr bright with the knowledge of  eternity stretching out before you you  can watch every movie and show play  every game and read every book that's  why dr bright sometimes resorts to more  esoteric methods of amusement such as  feeding the newbies little white lies  about anomalies like telling them  scp-682 can be tamed with a rolled-up  newspaper and tummy rubs like a  misbehaving puppy which must have seemed  really funny until six new researchers  got devoured and considering what a  nightmare employee turnaround is at the  scp foundation already losing employees  for a reason this stupid really didn't  sit well with the 05 council
 

